      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "References are important for suppliers, especially for small and medium enterprise (SME) suppliers seeking to grow their businesses. Often a successful contract with the public sector is a valuable potential reference for a small firm, and references can support growth for business.",
